  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Irregular participles",
     "texto": [
      "**feito** (done, from fazer), **dito** (said, from dizer), **visto** (seen, from ver), **escrito** (written, from escrever), **aberto** (opened, from abrir), **posto** (put, from pôr), **ido** (gone, from ir), **sido** (been, from ser), **tido** (had, from ter).",
      "With **ter**, the participle does not change: **tenho feito**, **tens visto**, **temos escrito**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Participle with «estar»",
     "texto": [
      "With **estar** the participle agrees with the subject: **A porta está aberta** (the door is open). With **ter** it does not agree."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
